d_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3188510-1814309641467274","game_id":"steam-3188510","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Closed! ⚓","summary":"Hi, Captains.The Playtest for Project Sever officially closed on October 23 — thank you all for diving in and sharing your invaluable feedback with us! The official demo will launch on November 7, 2025. If Project Sever sent shivers down your spine, don't forget to recommend it to your friends—and join forces to explore the darkest corners of the deep, uncovering secrets buried for decades beneath the waves...And of course—add Project Sever to your wishlist so you won’t miss the descent.Stay ale","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-24T08:26:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641467274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3188510-1811772772240040","game_id":"steam-3188510","kind":"announcement","title":"Project SEVER First Playtest is Live! 🚢","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋The first Steam Playtest for Project SEVER is now live!Playtest Period: Sept 25 – Oct 23Estimated Playtime: ~2 hoursVR Mode SupportedYou can unlock access simply by clicking “Request Access” on our store page.Please note that the game is still in early development.If you encounter any issues during your playtest, feel free to share your feedback with us via email (support@indieark.com) or on our Discord.We’re excited to hear your thoughts—thank you for helping us improve the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-25T10:14:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772240040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_